---
// Get Chosen: CMC's conversion method (rebuild/review-feedback.md items 1 and 8).
// The copy framework underneath is never named publicly (see the
// never-name-storybrand rule); describe it, don't brand it.
// Target: therapist website copy (KD 7) / therapist website copywriting.
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/site/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '../components/site/Section.astro';
import FeatureList from '../components/site/FeatureList.astro';
import SystemFit from '../components/site/SystemFit.astro';
import ProductShot from '../components/site/ProductShot.astro';
import Faq from '../components/site/Faq.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/site/CtaBand.astro';
import Ph from '../components/site/Ph.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/url';
import { FREEDOM_CONVERSION } from '../lib/site';
import { rootUrl, service } from '../lib/siteSchema';

const path = '/therapist-website-copywriting';
const description =
  "Therapist website copywriting and conversion: we help you get clear on who you serve, then write every page around your ideal client's story, so the right people know they've found their counselor.";
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Services', path: '/services' }, { name: 'Website Copy & Conversion', path }];
const faqs = [
  { q: 'Do I have to write my own website copy?', a: "No. We interview you about who you serve and how you work, then write it. You review every page, and nothing goes live until it sounds like you." },
  { q: "What if I see lots of different kinds of clients?", a: "Most counselors do. We still start with the people you most want to see and write each specialty page for the person searching for that help. A clear message attracts more of the right people, not fewer." },
  { q: 'Is this different from your website design?', a: 'They work together. Website design covers the build: pages, speed, search foundations. This is the message on those pages and how each one leads a visitor to reach out. Every website we build gets both.' },
  { q: 'Can you rewrite my current site without rebuilding it?', a: "Copy and conversion are part of every build, because the speed and the always-visible call to action live in the site itself. Your free audit shows what your current site is missing either way." },
];
const method = [
  { t: 'Know exactly who you serve', icon: 'target', d: "We start by getting clear on the clients you most want to see: what they're struggling with, what they've already tried, and what they're afraid of. Everything else is written for them." },
  { t: 'Name their pain, in their words', icon: 'chat-centered-text', d: "Someone looking for a counselor is usually having a hard time. Your pages describe what they're going through the way they'd describe it, so they feel understood before they ever call." },
  { t: 'Show empathy and competence', icon: 'hand-heart', d: "Warmth alone isn't enough, and neither are credentials alone. Each page shows that you understand, and that you're trained and experienced to help with this exact problem." },
  { t: 'Make the next step obvious', icon: 'path', d: "A simple, clear plan: reach out, talk for a few minutes, schedule a first session. No one should wonder what happens after they hit send." },
  { t: 'A way to reach you, always in view', icon: 'cursor-click', d: 'On every page and every screen size, requesting an appointment is one click away. Nobody has to hunt for a contact page.' },
  { t: 'Fast, on any phone', icon: 'lightning', d: "Many people search for a counselor late at night on their phone. Pages that load instantly keep them reading instead of giving up." },
];
const siteUrl = rootUrl(Astro.site, Astro.url);
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Therapist Website Copywriting That Brings the Right Clients"
  description={description}
  path={path}
  crumbs={crumbs}
  faqs={faqs}
  schema={[service(siteUrl, { name: 'Therapist Website Copywriting and Conversion', description, path, serviceType: 'Website copywriting' })]}
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Step 2 of the Full Caseload System: Get Chosen"
    title="The right clients should know, within seconds, that they've found their counselor."
    sub="We help you get clear on who you serve, then write every page around their story: the pain that brought them here, why you can help, and exactly what to do next."
    crumbs={crumbs}
  />

  <Section>
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.4fr] lg:gap-16">
      <h2 class="h2 lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:self-start">Getting found isn't the same as getting chosen.</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-[17px] text-muted">
        <p>
          Someone finds you on Google, clicks, and lands on a page that talks about your training, lists twelve specialties, and ends
          with "contact me." It's all true. It just doesn't tell them whether you're the right person for what they're going through.
          So they go back and click the next counselor.
        </p>
        <p>
          The practices that fill their caseloads aren't always the best clinicians. Their websites speak directly to the people they
          serve, show they can help, and make reaching out easy. That's what this step builds.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Our method for turning visitors into clients" intro="Every page we write and build follows the same approach.">
    <FeatureList items={method} />
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.4fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink">{FREEDOM_CONVERSION.rate}</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">of inquiries became clients ({FREEDOM_CONVERSION.detail})</p>
        <h2 class="h3 mt-8">Built this way for Freedom Counseling Services.</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[17px] text-muted">
          Each of Freedom's five counselors has a page written around the clients they see, and each specialty has a page written for
          the person searching for that help. Getting more inquiries matters, but so does who they are: the right people, who already
          know Freedom is a fit when they reach out.
        </p>
        <a href={withBase('/results/freedom-counseling-services')} class="link-arrow mt-5">See Freedom's story <Ph name="arrow-right" class="size-4" /></a>
      </div>
      <ProductShot shot="freedom-home" />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="What changes after we work together" narrow>
    <p class="text-[17px] text-muted">
      Your website, your Google profile, and every page in between say precisely who you serve and how you help. When the right person
      finds you, they don't have to guess. They recognize themselves in what they read, trust that you can help, and know exactly how to
      take the first step.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <SystemFit
    current="chosen"
    text="Getting found brings people to your site. This step is what makes them reach out, and fast follow-up turns that inquiry into a first session."
  />
  <Faq faqs={faqs} />
  <CtaBand title="Find out how your site reads to a first-time client." body="Your free audit shows what someone sees when they land on your site, and where they're likely to give up." />
</SiteLayout>
